OL,3,GNEWSAMan who threatened ex-partner
OL,4,Aspared jail
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who threatened to slit the throat
OL,7,Fof his ex-partner and set fire to her
OL,8,Fhome has been given a suspended prison
OL,9,Fsentence.
OL,11,FDavid McGurty, 37, of Bracken Ridge,
OL,12,FCarlisle, left two former partners
OL,13,Ffearing the worst during drug-fuelled
OL,14,Foffending in late July and early
OL,15,FAugust.
OL,17,FHe made a number of chilling threats
OL,18,Fincluding that he would "ram a vehicle
OL,19,Finto her house, set fire to her address
OL,20,Fand use a knife to slit her throat",
OL,21,Fprosecutor George Shelley told Carlisle
OL,22,FMagistrates' Court.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
